!C4H + CH2CCH2 = H + C7H4                         :  1.90E-10    -0.820       47.2 :     39      298 : A : 2010BERb, assumed branching ratio 1.0 based on C2H + CH2CCH2
!
 O + H2 = OH + H                                  :  4.60E-14     3.500     2500.0 :    298     3300 : A : fit to complex expression in 2005BAU
