!OH + C2H5 = H2CO + H + CH3                       :  1.00E-11     0.000        0.0 :    200      400 : A : 1993FAG, endothermic by 98.6 kJ/mol, unclear interpretation of channel 1c involving a third body
!OH + C4H2 = products                             :  1.00E-11     0.000        0.0 :    290      670 : B : 2015SOM, addition, products are uncertain (H2C4O + H ?)
!OH + C4H4 = products                             :  6.40E-12     0.000     -486.0 :    295      740 : B : 2015SOM, addition, products are uncertain (C4H4O + H, C3H2O + CH3 ?)
!OH + C4H4 = H2CO + C3H3                          :  1.70E-11     0.000        0.0 :    300     2000 : C : 2017CHR (Konnov v0.6), removed because of the above arguments
 OH + OH = O + H2O                                :  5.50E-14     2.420     -970.0 :    250     2400 : A : 2005BAU
