 O_1D + M = O + M                                 :  1.80E-11     0.000     -107.0 :                                :         :           :     N2 :    100      350 :                 :                 : B : LOW: 1997ATK
!
! Special case (see 2007JASa). It is a pressure-dependent reaction, but in this case k_low is in units of cm3 s-1 (instead of cm6 s-1) and k_high is in units of s-1 (instead of cm3 s-1).
! Instead of the usual falloff expression, here the expression in Eq (13) of 2007JASa is used.
!
!
!
